From freebsd-alpha  Wed May 30 09:31:01 2001
From: Sudish Joseph <sudish () mindspring ! com>
Date: Wed, 30 May 2001 09:31:01 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: alpha/27766: /usr/bin/ppp issues unaligned accesses and core dumps on an alpha
